### Listar productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Ver perfil autenticado cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}

### Obtener carrito cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}

### Guardar carrito cliente con personalizacion
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productTitle": "Tabla Cocina Grabada",
      "productId": "REEMPLAZA_PRODUCT_ID",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 31,
      "basePrice": 31,
      "variantAdditionalPrice": 0,
      "simpleSku": "WOOD-TABLA-BAMBU-005",
      "image": "/uploads/1776006623846.JPG",
      "customization": {
        "customText": "Casa de la Familia Cerezo",
        "uploadedImageUrl": "/uploads/1776536161330.png"
      }
    }
  ],
  "lastUpdated": 1777000000000
}

### Checkout desde carrito
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": {
    "fullName": "Lucia Cerezo",
    "phone": "+34 600111222",
    "line1": "Calle de la Madera 12",
    "city": "Valencia",
    "postalCode": "46001",
    "province": "Valencia",
    "country": "ES"
  }
}

### Obtener pedidos del cliente autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}

### Obtener todos los pedidos (actualmente solo requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
